{"version":1,"content":"<p>新浪科技訊 11月23日晚間消息，近日有博主爆料稱，懂車帝內部對公開測試發佈了四項要求，包括不再開放對比類內容、想要發佈公開測試類內容的賬號必須有資質等。懂車帝方面則表示，網傳「內容大調整」「行業受影響」等信息多處失實，部分內容為AI撰寫，未跟平台核實求證。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587632.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T11:53:38.822531+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T11:44:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T11:47:02.809976+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T11:47:02.809976+00:00","content_hash":"cfe3641b3582570e64007efcd9a72613fd6d7602b275b5e41ba858bd13f00184","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}